# 📝 To-Do List Backend

This repository contains the backend of the To-Do List web application, built using **Node.js**, **Express.js**, and **MongoDB**.

---

## 🔧 Tech Stack

- **Backend:** Node.js, Express.js  
- **Database:** MongoDB (Mongoose ORM)  
- **Authentication:** JWT (JSON Web Tokens) with bcrypt  
- **Environment Management:** dotenv  
- **Version Control:** Git & GitHub  

---

## ⚙️ Features

- JWT-based user authentication (secure registration, login, and logout)  
- CRUD operations for notes with categories, search, filter, sort, and pagination  
- Secure personal vault for private notes with secondary password and activity logging  
- Notes management with categories like Daily Journal, Thought of the Day, Memories  
- Ensures data persistence with MongoDB and schema validation  

---

